---
/**
 * Favicon links. The whole set lives in `public/` at stable URLs — no
 * content-hashed imports. Every export is the brand mark on a solid
 * `#FCFBF7` plate, so the mark keeps its navy on dark browser chrome.
 * Regenerate the set together (see the note in `site.config.ts`).
 */
---

<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="16x16 32x32 48x48" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="/favicon.png" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
